### AutoHub API - Tenants Demo Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@portalUrl = http://rederevenda.com
@tenant1Url = http://autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com
@tenant2Url = http://sp-veiculos.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 1. Welcome Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Resolve Active Tenant info (Main Portal Context - No domain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

### 3. Resolve Active Tenant info (AutoCar Natal Tenant Context)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 4. Resolve Active Tenant info (SP Veículos Tenant Context)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
Accept: application/json
Host: sp-veiculos.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 5. List All Stores (Backoffice Central Context)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stores
Accept: application/json

### 6. Provision a New Store (Tenant Creation Wizard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stores
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Euro Select Motors",
  "subdomain": "euro-select",
  "whatsapp_number": "5511988888888",
  "accent_color": "#1d4ed8",
  "plan": "anual"
}

### 7. Toggle Store Status (Activate / Inactivate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stores/1/toggle
Accept: application/json
